# Licences of what Deckhand bundles

Deckhand itself is under the MIT licence (`LICENSE`, beside this file). Built into it is the work of
others, each under its own licence, whose terms ask that its notice travel with every copy. Here they
all are: first the Rust crates compiled into the binary, each licence text as the crate itself ships
it and with every crate that uses that exact text named above it; then what cargo does not see — the
C libraries built in with argosy-sigil, the fonts and the icons.

A crate offered under a choice of licences is listed under the one Deckhand takes.

